<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cricket-Zimbabwe beat India by three wickets.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Zimbabwe beat India by three wickets.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat India by three wickets in a rain-affected day/night match at Centurion Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>India: 216 all out from 48.4 overs. Zimbabwe: (set a reduced target of 171 from 34 overs after rain) 171-7 from 33.4 overs.</p>
</text>
